@startuml Manager Audit Log
title Sequence Diagram: Ghi lại nhật ký kiểm toán với Spring AOP (Task 8)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor "Manager/Staff" as User
participant "Any Controller/Service" as Target
participant "AuditAspect (AOP)" as Aspect
participant "AuditService" as Svc
database "Database" as DB

User -> Target: Thực hiện hành động (CRUD Movie, Showtime, etc.)
activate Target

Target -> Aspect: [Before/Around Advice] Intercept Operation
activate Aspect

Aspect -> Aspect: Lấy thông tin User (SecurityContext)
Aspect -> Aspect: Lấy thông tin Action (Method Name, Params)

Aspect -> Svc: logAction(user, action, targetId, details)
activate Svc
Svc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs
Svc --> Aspect: Success
deactivate Svc

Aspect -> Target: Proceed with Business Logic
deactivate Aspect

Target --> User: Response Kết quả
deactivate Target
@enduml
